  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-I (Reactants)</td> <td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-II Products</td> </tr> <tr> <td>(A)</td> <td>Phenol, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mo>/</mo><mo>∆</mo></math></td> <td>(I)</td> <td>Salicylaldehyde</td> </tr> <tr> <td>(B)</td> <td>Phenol, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CHCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math></td> <td>(II)</td> <td>Salicylic acid</td> </tr> <tr> <td>(C)</td> <td>Phenol, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math></td> <td>(III)</td> <td>Benzene</td> </tr> <tr> <td>(D)</td> <td>Phenol, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext> Conc. </mtext><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td> <td>(IV)</td> <td>Picric acid</td> </tr> </tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
